[00:13.15]1. Jesus has commanded
[00:16.89]That we shine our light,
[00:21.31]Like the sun, impartial,
[00:25.31]Comforting and bright.
[00:29.31]Through the Holy Scriptures,
[00:33.31]Thoughts of peace are heard.
[00:37.31]May we now reflect his light
[00:41.81]As we teach God’s Word.
[00:50.68]2. Let God’s Kingdom message
[00:54.68]Speak to ev’ry heart;
[00:58.68]Let it shine before us
[01:02.68]As we play our part.
[01:07.29]Light from Scripture guides us
[01:11.45]As we bring good news.
[01:15.53]Sharing truth with ev’ryone;
[01:19.77]Truth is theirs to choose.
[01:28.22]3. Light from acts of kindness
[01:32.22]Brightens up this world,
[01:36.22]To our words adds beauty
[01:40.22]Like a priceless pearl.
[01:44.22]May our light keep shining
[01:48.22]As we do what’s right,
[01:53.37]Then our works will always be
[01:57.37]Pleasing in God’s sight.